  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige har st&#xF6;tt landsbygdsutveckling i Makedonien sedan 2001. F&#xF6;r att utv&#xE4;rdera och samla ihop erfarenheter fr&#xE5;n de olika insatserna har konsulten Lars-Erik Birgeg&#xE5;rd anlitas att genomf&#xF6;ra workshops och rapporter.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sweden has supported rural development in Macedonia since 2001. in order to collect lessons learned and experiences for the future, Lars-Erik Birgeg&#xE5;rd was assigned as a consultant to carry out some workshops and write a report.</narrative>
